<br />
<& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"<i>Nicotiana benthamiana</i> 基因組草圖序列 v1.0.1(<i>Nicotiana benthamiana</i> draft genome sequence v1.0.1)" &>

<p>
  <a href="http://btiscience.org/" target="_blank">博伊斯湯普森植物研究所 (BTI)</a> 的研究人員發布了本氏菸草 (<i>Nicotiana benthamiana</i>) 基因組的新草圖序列。可透過 SGN BLAST 工具和 JBrowse 訪問，並可從 SGN FTP 網站下載。有關此計畫的更多資訊，請訪問 <a href="https://btiscience.org/our-research/research-facilities/research-resources/nicotiana-benthamiana/" target="_blank">BTI <i>Nicotiana benthamiana</i> 計畫網站(BTI Nicotiana benthamiana Project site)</a>。(A new draft sequence of the <i>Nicotiana benthamiana</i> genome has been released by researchers from the <a href="http://btiscience.org/" target="_blank">Boyce Thompson Institute for Plant Research (BTI)</a>. It is accessible through the SGN BLAST tool and JBrowse, and can be downloaded from the SGN ftp site. More information about this project can be found at the <a href="https://btiscience.org/our-research/research-facilities/research-resources/nicotiana-benthamiana/" target="_blank">BTI <i>Nicotiana benthamiana</i> Project site</a>)
</p>

<p>
  <i>N. benthamiana</i> 擁有非常複雜的基因組，由 n=19 條染色體組成，估計大小超過 3.5GB。在分類學上，它是 Suaveolentes 組的古老異源四倍體，由來自 Sylvestres 組和 Noctiflorae 組的二倍體親本形成。原產於澳洲 [2, 3]。(<i>N. benthamiana</i> has a very complex genome consisting of n=19 chromosomes that is estimated at over 3.5GB in size. Taxonomically, it is an old allotetraploid of the section Suaveolentes that was formed from diploid parents from the section Sylvestres and the section Noctiflorae. It is native to Australia [2, 3].)
</p>

<p>
  <i>N. benthamiana</i> 是植物-微生物生物學和其他研究應用中廣泛使用的模型。它特別有用，因為它與番茄和馬鈴薯相關，並且適用於病毒誘導的基因沉默 (VIGS)，這有助於植物基因的高效功能研究。(<i>N. benthamiana</i> is a widely used model for plant-microbe biology and other research applications. It is particularly useful because it is related to tomato and potato and is amenable to virus-induced gene silencing (VIGS) which facilitates the efficient functional study of plant genes.)
</p>

<p>
  <i>N. benthamiana</i> 的草圖序列將有助於更好地設計用於病毒誘導基因沉默 (VIGS) 的構建體，以減少「脫靶」基因沉默的可能性 [1]。該序列還將有助於鑑定番茄和馬鈴薯的直系同源基因，以用於與其他茄科物種的比較基因組學，並檢索啟動子序列。(The draft sequence of <i>N. benthamiana</i> will allow better design of constructs for virus-induced gene-silencing (VIGS) in order to reduce the possibility of 'off-target' gene silencing [1]. The sequence will be also useful to identify tomato and potato orthologs for comparative genomics with other Solanaceae species and, to retrieve promoter sequences.)
</p>


