<h4>數據協議(Data Agreement)</h4>

<p>
  存取 <i>Nicotiana benthamiana</i> 基因組數據，即表示您同意在 Benthamiana 定序和註釋聯盟 (BSAC) 發表論文之前，不發表任何包含全基因空間或全基因組規模分析的文章。這些分析包括鑑定全套（全基因組）基因組特徵，例如基因、基因家族、調控元件、重複結構、GC 含量或任何其他基因組特徵，以及與其他物種的全基因組或染色體規模比對。科學使用者可自由發表基於單一基因（或基因群）的分析。(Accessing to the <i>Nicotiana benthamiana</i> genome data, you agree not to publish any article containing any analysis of the whole gene space or whole genome scale prior to the publication by the Benthamiana Sequencing and Annotation Consortium (BSAC). These analysis include the identification of complete (whole genome) sets of genomic features such as genes, gene families, regulatory elements, repeat structures, GC content, or any other genome feature, and whole-genome- or chromosome- scale comparisons with other species. Scientific users are free to publish analysis based in a single gene (or group of genes).)
</p>

<p>
若有任何疑問，請聯絡 <a href="mailto:gbm7@cornell.edu">Gregory Martin</a> 教授或 <a href="mailto:aurebg@vt.edu">Aureliano Bombarely</a> 教授。(If you have any questions, please contact Professor <a href="mailto:gbm7@cornell.edu">Gregory Martin</a> or Professor <a href="mailto:aurebg@vt.edu">Aureliano Bombarely</a>.)
</p>

